  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>With a grand gesture, the rajah extends her indomitable will to her allies. Starting at 14th level, a rajah can grant one of her allies the effect of her indomitable class feature for a single Will save against a mind-affecting effect. She can only do so once per round, and activating this ability is a free action that can be taken even if it isn’t her turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/rajah#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
